From: SteamPhone Project <steamphone@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] arm64: dts: qcom: Add firmware path for BCM4375 WiFi
Date: Mon, 1 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000
Signed-off-by: SteamPhone Project <steamphone@example.com>
---

Add firmware path for BCM4375 WiFi chip found in some S20 FE variants.

Note: This is a STUB patch. WiFi chip variant needs verification.
- SM-G781N (Snapdragon) may use different WiFi than Exynos variants

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/bcm4375-firmware.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/bcm4375-firmware.dtsi
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..2345678
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/bcm4375-firmware.dtsi
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+/*
+ * BCM4375 WiFi firmware configuration
+ * Firmware files needed:
+ *   - brcm/brcmfmac4375-pcie.bin
+ *   - brcm/brcmfmac4375-pcie.clm_blob
+ */
+
+&wifi {
+	firmware-name = "brcm/brcmfmac4375-pcie.bin";
+	clm-blob = "brcm/brcmfmac4375-pcie.clm_blob";
+	status = "okay";
+};
